ons-d035", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "style_guide_path": "config/style-guide.md", "turn_id": "01a21a22-145e-73a3-8454-885620a9a6b1", "unit_id": "tag:01NS:prose-0001"}, "context_hash": "sha256:9712a53c94980c6f0709be270d7541a52cc49c111aa0b595f411c8858487b3e0", "created_at": "2026-11-26T23:12:51.705Z", "glossary_revision": "git:0cd5a696ed1fb6b267587570250073149a81bf7f", "harness_id": "codex", "harness_version": "0.172.0", "model_id": "gpt-6.2-sol", "model_identity_confidence": "declared", "model_lane": "openai-gpt-6.2-sol", "model_record_id": "openai:gpt-6.2-sol:declared", "model_snapshot": null, "notes": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "publication_status": "CANDIDATE", "qa_status": "PASS", "reasoning_effort": "high", "run_id": "run-p1-27-constructions-d035", "schema_version": 2, "source_adoption_id": "p1-27-constructions-d035", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_text_hash": "sha256:eca399ef6fa951e3bd8e450822889fe239c31b750d2d39fb8ab0ddc47b2447f3", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "relative homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "相对齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "represent", "target_term": "表示"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine opens", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "relative spectrum", "target_term": "相对谱"}, {"source_term": "glueing", "target_term": "拼接"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "Algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quadruples", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "homomorphism", "target_term": "同态"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebras", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "pull it back", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "quadruples", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "strictly equivalent", "target_term": "严格等价"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "strict", "target_term": "严格"}, {"source_term": "equivalence classes", "target_term": "等价类"}, {"source_term": "pullbacks", "target_term": "拉回"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们在情形<REF_0001>下工作。\n于是，<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme），而<MATH_0002>是一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的分次（graded）<MATH_0003>-代数（algebra）。\n本节将<MATH_0004>的构造相对化，方法是构造一个函子（functor），使相对齐次谱（relative homogeneous spectrum）表示（represent）它。\n由此，我们将构造一个态射（morphism），即概形（schemes）之间的<MATH_0005>。\n在<MATH_0006>的仿射开集（affine opens）上方，它将形如齐次谱（homogeneous spectrum），其中取谱的对象是一个分次环（graded ring）。\n这里的讨论将仿照第<REF_0002>节中关于相对谱（relative spectrum）的讨论。\n通过拼接（glueing）形如<MATH_0007>的概形（schemes）来构造的方法较为简便，其中<MATH_0008>，<MATH_0009>为仿射开集（affine open）。\n第<REF_0003>节说明了这一方法，我们将证明本节的结果与该方法所得的结果同构（isomorphic）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n暂且固定一个整数（integer）<MATH_0010>。\n我们记<MATH_0011>，记法仿照《代数（Algebra）》第<REF_0004>节。\n设<MATH_0012>为一个概形（scheme）。\n考虑<TEXTITOPEN_0001>四元组（quadruples）<MATH_0013>（在<MATH_0014>上）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，其中\n<STRUCT_0004>\n<STRUCT_0005> <MATH_0015>是上面固定的整数（integer），\n<STRUCT_0006> <MATH_0016>是一个态射（morphism），其源和目标都是概形（schemes），\n<STRUCT_0007> <MATH_0017>是一个可逆（invertible）<MATH_0018>-模（module），并且\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<MATH_0019>是一个同态（homomorphism），它保持分次（graded）<MATH_0020>-代数（algebras）结构，且<MATH_0021>是满射（surjective）。\n<STRUCT_0009>\n给定态射（morphism）<MATH_0022>和四元组（quadruple）<MATH_0023>（在<MATH_0024>上），可将后者拉回（pull it back）为四元组（quadruple）<MATH_0025>（在<MATH_0026>上）。\n给定四元组（quadruples）<MATH_0027>和<MATH_0028>，二者均在<MATH_0029>上，且具有相同的整数（integer）<MATH_0030>。\n称它们<TEXTITOPEN_0002>严格等价（strictly equivalent）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，当且仅当<MATH_0031>且存在同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0032>，使得<MATH_0033>作为分次（graded）<MATH_0034>-代数（algebra）的映射（maps）<MATH_0035>之间的等式成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0010><STRUCT_0011>\n对每个整数（integer）<MATH_0036>，我们定义\n<MATHSEG_0001>严格（strict）等价类（equivalence classes），其元素为<MATHSEG_0002>（如上所述）<MATHSEG_0003>\n其中拉回（pullbacks）如上定义。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:41027dc3dd3fcd9412ca80aa74ef36ad3eabbaf092346b577008421b5b84218c", "unit_id": "tag:01NS:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "描述给定底空间的对象类型。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "限定给定分次代数的层性质。", "source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"context": "限定给定代数的分次结构。", "source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"context": "指给定底结构上的代数。", "source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "指将由相对齐次谱表示的函子。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "指表示所构造函子的相对对象。", "source_term": "relative homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "相对齐次谱"}, {"context": "描述相对齐次谱和所构造函子的关系。", "source_term": "represent", "target_term": "表示"}, {"context": "指本节将构造的箭头。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term":